// WHAT: Extensions VS Code recommends when you open this repo. A popup offers to install them.
//   - Prettier: formats your code (used by format-on-save in settings.json)
//   - Tailwind CSS IntelliSense: autocompletes Tailwind classes and previews their CSS
// WITHOUT IT: Format-on-save would silently do nothing for anyone without the Prettier
//   extension, and Tailwind class names would get no autocomplete.
{
  "recommendations": ["esbenp.prettier-vscode", "bradlc.vscode-tailwindcss"]
}
